- `log.createPatch`: `Face 84 specified in set f0 is not an external face`
  - Root cause: the `boxToFace` selection in `system/topoSetDict` is selecting at least one internal face, so `createPatch` cannot convert it into boundary patch `inlet`.
  - Fix: constrain the box so it only intersects the **bottom boundary faces** (y=0 plane) with a very thin y-range around the boundary, e.g. keep x/z as requested and use a tiny y slab near 0 so no interior face is captured.
