- After `createPatch -overwrite`, re-open `constant/polyMesh/boundary` to confirm only expected patches and names are present.
- If you see an undefined keyword error later (e.g. `div(phi,(p|rho)) is undefined`), add that **exact same keyword** to `system/fvSchemes` under `divSchemes` with an appropriate scheme entry, literally as printed in the error.

